WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Shocked.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.980
And there’s a sense of betrayal too.

3
00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:12.080
To learn that it was Catholic Jesuit priests that were involved in this instead of providing sanctuary.

4
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:21.440
They were engaging in this practice of human trafficking, is really what it amounts to.

5
00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:25.340
Profiting off of another human is what they engaged in.

6
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:29.660
And you know, growing up as a Catholic it was like—how could they do that?

7
00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:36.360
And you know, doesn’t that violate all of the tenets of the Catholic Church and what you know about it,

8
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:41.500
or what we knew about it as young people growing up with the Catholic Church?

9
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.280
It was shocking.

10
00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:47.580
It was disturbing, and it kind of rocks the center of your core, because [of] who you think you are.

11
00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:52.087
And then you discover that it’s something different, or something more than that.
